ultades, con lo que las blancas logran supremacía central.)","fen":"r1bqk2r/pp1nbppp/2p1p3/3n2B1/3P4/2N1PN2/PP3PPP/R2QKB1R w KQkq - 0 8","gap":false},{"n":8,"color":"w","san":"Bxe7","uci":"g5e7","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bqk2r/pp1nBppp/2p1p3/3n4/3P4/2N1PN2/PP3PPP/R2QKB1R b KQkq - 0 8","gap":false},{"n":8,"color":"b","san":"Nxe7","uci":"d5e7","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bqk2r/pp1nnppp/2p1p3/8/3P4/2N1PN2/PP3PPP/R2QKB1R w KQkq - 0 9","gap":false},{"n":9,"color":"w","san":"Bd3","uci":"f1d3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bqk2r/pp1nnppp/2p1p3/8/3P4/2NBPN2/PP3PPP/R2QK2R b KQkq - 1 9","gap":false},{"n":9,"color":"b","san":"c5","uci":"c6c5","nag":"","comentario":"(Correcto. Al menos la negras tienen que procurar eliminar uno de los peones centrales blancos, para no quedar peor)","fen":"r1bqk2r/pp1nnppp/4p3/2p5/3P4/2NBPN2/PP3PPP/R2QK2R w KQkq - 0 10","gap":false},{"n":10,"color":"w","san":"O-O","uci":"e1g1","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bqk2r/pp1nnppp/4p3/2p5/3P4/2NBPN2/PP3PPP/R2Q1RK1 b kq - 1 10","gap":false},{"n":10,"color":"b","san":"O-O","uci":"e8g8","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1rk1/pp1nnppp/4p3/2p5/3P4/2NBPN2/PP3PPP/R2Q1RK1 w - - 2 11","gap":false},{"n":11,"color":"w","san":"dxc5","uci":"d4c5","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1rk1/pp1nnppp/4p3/2P5/8/2NBPN2/PP3PPP/R2Q1RK1 b - - 0 11","gap":false},{"n":11,"color":"b","san":"Nxc5","uci":"d7c5","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1rk1/pp2nppp/4p3/2n5/8/2NBPN2/PP3PPP/R2Q1RK1 w - - 0 12","gap":false},{"n":12,"color":"w","san":"Bxh7+","uci":"d3h7","nag":"","comentario":"(En esta posición el sacrificio es mucho menos claro, pues las blancas tienen pocas piezas para desarrollar su ataque. De todas maneras, las negras tendrán que jugar con mucha precisión para defenderse. Parece que con un juego correcto las blancas no deberían tener más que tablas, por lo que estrictamente hablando, el sacrificio no es suficiente para lograr ventaja. Pero desde el punto de vista práctico, sirve para poner en muchos problemas al negro y el riesgo que corren las blancas es muy pequeño)","fen":"r1bq1rk1/pp2nppB/4p3/2n5/8/2N1PN2/PP3PPP/R2Q1RK1 b - - 0 12","gap":false},{"n":12,"color":"b","san":"Kxh7","uci":"g8h7","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp2nppk/4p3/2n5/8/2N1PN2/PP3PPP/R2Q1RK1 w - - 0 13","gap":false},{"n":13,"color":"w","san":"Ng5+","uci":"f3g5","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp2nppk/4p3/2n3N1/8/2N1P3/PP3PPP/R2Q1RK1 b - - 1 13","gap":false},{"n":13,"color":"b","san":"Kg6","uci":"h7g6","nag":"","comentario":"(Como suele ocurrir, el rey debe salir a campo abierto, pues si 13...Rg8 14.Dh5 Te8 (14...Dd3 15.e4 es parecido) 15.Dxf7+ Rh8 y las blancas tienen un ataque decisivo, pues la simple 16.Tad1 Ad7 17.b4 recupera el material con ventaja)","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp2npp1/4p1k1/2n3N1/8/2N1P3/PP3PPP/R2Q1RK1 w - - 2 14","gap":false},{"n":14,"color":"w","san":"Qg4","uci":"d1g4","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp2npp1/4p1k1/2n3N1/6Q1/2N1P3/PP3PPP/R4RK1 b - - 3 14","gap":false},{"n":14,"color":"b","san":"f5","uci":"f7f5","nag":"","comentario":"(Forzado, pues si 14...e5 15.Ce6+ Rf6 las blancas incorporan nuevas fuerzas al ataque con 16.f4! y si 16...e4 17.Dg5+ Rxe6 18.De5+ Rd7 19.Tfd1+ Cd3 20.Cxe4 ganando pues si 20...Rc6 21.Txd3 Dxd3 22.Tc1+)","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp2n1p1/4p1k1/2n2pN1/6Q1/2N1P3/PP3PPP/R4RK1 w - - 0 15","gap":false},{"n":15,"color":"w","san":"Qg3","uci":"g4g3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp2n1p1/4p1k1/2n2pN1/8/2N1P1Q1/PP3PPP/R4RK1 b - - 1 15","gap":false},{"n":15,"color":"b","san":"Kh6","uci":"g6h6","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp2n1p1/4p2k/2n2pN1/8/2N1P1Q1/PP3PPP/R4RK1 w - - 2 16","gap":false},{"n":16,"color":"w","san":"Qh4+","uci":"g3h4","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp2n1p1/4p2k/2n2pN1/7Q/2N1P3/PP3PPP/R4RK1 b - - 3 16","gap":false},{"n":16,"color":"b","san":"Kg6","uci":"h6g6","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp2n1p1/4p1k1/2n2pN1/7Q/2N1P3/PP3PPP/R4RK1 w - - 4 17","gap":false},{"n":17,"color":"w","san":"Qh7+","uci":"h4h7","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp2n1pQ/4p1k1/2n2pN1/8/2N1P3/PP3PPP/R4RK1 b - - 5 17","gap":false},{"n":17,"color":"b","san":"Kf6","uci":"g6f6","nag":"","comentario":"(No vale 17...Rxg5 18.Dxg7+ Rh5 19.f4 Cg8 20.Tf3 ganando. Después de la jugada de la partida se produce una posición donde las variantes no son forzadas. Las blancas tienen una pieza de menos pero la posición expuesta del rey negro compensa esta desventaja. Sin un análisis muy detallado, imposible de realizar en la partida viva, no puede asegurarse que el sacrificio baste para ganar o por el contrario las negras pueden defenderse satisfactoriamente, pero esa es la esencia de muchos sacrificios que deben basarse en la intuición.)","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp2n1pQ/4pk2/2n2pN1/8/2N1P3/PP3PPP/R4RK1 w - - 6 18","gap":false},{"n":18,"color":"w","san":"e4","uci":"e3e4","nag":"","comentario":"(Amenazando e5+. Otra forma de llevar el ataque podría ser 18.Dh5 pero eso solo parece dar tablas después de 18...g6 19.Dh4 Rg7 20.Dh7+ Rf6 21.Dh4)","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp2n1pQ/4pk2/2n2pN1/4P3/2N5/PP3PPP/R4RK1 b - - 0 18","gap":false},{"n":18,"color":"b","san":"Ng6","uci":"e7g6","nag":"","comentario":"(Otra posibilidad era 18...Cd3 aunque luego de 19.Tad1 las negras no tendrían nada mejor que 19...Cg6 transponiendo a la partida.)","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp4pQ/4pkn1/2n2pN1/4P3/2N5/PP3PPP/R4RK1 w - - 1 19","gap":false},{"n":19,"color":"w","san":"exf5","uci":"e4f5","nag":"","comentario":"(Según el propio Capablanca, era más fuerte 19.f4 para si 19...fxe4 20.Tad1 Db6 21.Td6 con amenazas decisivas. Sin embargo, tras 19...Dd4+ 20.Rh1 Cxe4 21.Ccxe4+ fxe4 22.Tad1 las negras tienen el recurso 22...Dxd1! 23.Txd1 Th8 y las blancas no tienen nada mejor que hacer tablas con 24.Cxe4+ Rf7 25.Cg5+ Rf6. Con la jugada de la partida, las negras pueden llegar a quedar mejor, pero tampoco acertarán con la defensa adecuada)","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp4pQ/4pkn1/2n2PN1/8/2N5/PP3PPP/R4RK1 b - - 0 19","gap":false},{"n":19,"color":"b","san":"exf5","uci":"e6f5","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp4pQ/5kn1/2n2pN1/8/2N5/PP3PPP/R4RK1 w - - 0 20","gap":false},{"n":20,"color":"w","san":"Rad1","uci":"a1d1","nag":"","comentario":"(20.Dh5 Th8 21.Ch7+ Txh7 22.Dxh7 Ae6 es bueno para las negras.)","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp4pQ/5kn1/2n2pN1/8/2N5/PP3PPP/3R1RK1 b - - 1 20","gap":false},{"n":20,"color":"b","san":"Nd3","uci":"c5d3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp4pQ/5kn1/5pN1/8/2Nn4/PP3PPP/3R1RK1 w - - 2 21","gap":false},{"n":21,"color":"w","san":"Qh3","uci":"h7h3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp4p1/5kn1/5pN1/8/2Nn3Q/PP3PPP/3R1RK1 b - - 3 21","gap":false},{"n":21,"color":"b","san":"Ndf4","uci":"d3f4","nag":"?","comentario":"(Era necesario 21...Cgf4 22.Dg3 Th8 y parece que las negras pueden defenderse bien, por ejemplo: 23.Td2 Ae6 24.Cxe6 (24.Tfd1 Ac4) 24...Rxe6 25.Ce2 Dc7)","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp4p1/5kn1/5pN1/5n2/2N4Q/PP3PPP/3R1RK1 w - - 4 22","gap":false},{"n":22,"color":"w","san":"Qg3","uci":"h3g3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1r2/pp4p1/5kn1/5pN1/5n2/2N3Q1/PP3PPP/3R1RK1 b - - 5 22","gap":false},{"n":22,"color":"b","san":"Qc7","uci":"d8c7","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1b2r2/ppq3p1/5kn1/5pN1/5n2/2N3Q1/PP3PPP/3R1RK1 w - - 6 23","gap":false},{"n":23,"color":"w","san":"Rfe1","uci":"f1e1","nag":"!","comentario":"(A pesar de que las negras tienen ventaja material, son las blancas quienes tienen superioridad de fuerzas en acción. Sin duda las blancas tienen suficiente compensación, aunque el siguiente error de las negras facilita mucho la tarea)","fen":"r1b2r2/ppq3p1/5kn1/5pN1/5n2/2N3Q1/PP3PPP/3RR1K1 b - - 7 23","gap":false},{"n":23,"color":"b","san":"Ne2+","uci":"f4e2","nag":"?","comentario":"(Después de 23...Th8 todavía quedaría mucha partida por delante. En cambio otras posibilidades son débiles:; 23...Ae6? 24.Txe6+ Cxe6 25.Cd5#; 23...Ad7? 24.Cd5+ Cxd5 25.Dxc7 Cxc7 26.Ch7+ Rf7 27.Txd7+)","fen":"r1b2r2/ppq3p1/5kn1/5pN1/8/2N3Q1/PP2nPPP/3RR1K1 w - - 8 24","gap":false},{"n":24,"color":"w","san":"Rxe2","uci":"e1e2","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1b2r2/ppq3p1/5kn1/5pN1/8/2N3Q1/PP2RPPP/3R2K1 b - - 0 24","gap":false},{"n":24,"color":"b","san":"Qxg3","uci":"c7g3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1b2r2/pp4p1/5kn1/5pN1/8/2N3q1/PP2RPPP/3R2K1 w - - 0 25","gap":false},{"n":25,"color":"w","san":"Nh7+","uci":"g5h7","nag":"","comentario":"(Al parecer las negras omitieron este jaque intermedio. La partida queda decidida)","fen":"r1b2r2/pp4pN/5kn1/5p2/8/2N3q1/PP2RPPP/3R2K1 b - - 1 25","gap":false},{"n":25,"color":"b","san":"Kf7","uci":"f6f7","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1b2r2/pp3kpN/6n1/5p2/8/2N3q1/PP2RPPP/3R2K1 w - - 2 26","gap":false},{"n":26,"color":"w","san":"hxg3","uci":"h2g3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1b2r2/pp3kpN/6n1/5p2/8/2N3P1/PP2RPP1/3R2K1 b - - 0 26","gap":false},{"n":26,"color":"b","san":"Rh8","uci":"f8h8","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1b4r/pp3kpN/6n1/5p2/8/2N3P1/PP2RPP1/3R2K1 w - - 1 27","gap":false},{"n":27,"color":"w","san":"Ng5+","uci":"h7g5","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1b4r/pp3kp1/6n1/5pN1/8/2N3P1/PP2RPP1/3R2K1 b - - 2 27","gap":false},{"n":27,"color":"b","san":"Kf6","uci":"f7f6","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1b4r/pp4p1/5kn1/5pN1/8/2N3P1/PP2RPP1/3R2K1 w - - 3 28","gap":false},{"n":28,"color":"w","san":"f4","uci":"f2f4","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1b4r/pp4p1/5kn1/5pN1/5P2/2N3P1/PP2R1P1/3R2K1 b - - 0 28","gap":false}],"diagramas":[22],"resumen":"","fragmento":false,"claves":[{"ply":45,"pregunta":"¿Qué jugaron aquí las blancas?","pista":"La jugada es de una torre.","explicacion":"(A pesar de que las negras tienen ventaja material, son las blancas quienes tienen superioridad de fuerzas en acción. Sin duda las blancas tienen suficiente compensación, aunque el siguiente error de las negras facilita mucho la tarea)","alternativas":["h2h4"],"motor":"Stockfish 16: Tfe1 +2.2 (también vale h4)."}]},"ml127-4":{"id":"ml127-4","blancas":"G. Kasparov","negras":"DEEP JUNIOR","evento":"New York, 2003","apertura":"","eco":"","resultado":"½-½","start_fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1","orientacion":"w","moves":[{"n":1,"color":"w","san":"d4","uci":"d2d4","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/3P4/8/PPP1PPPP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq - 0 1","gap":false},{"n":1,"color":"b","san":"Nf6","uci":"g8f6","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqkb1r/pppppppp/5n2/8/3P4/8/PPP1PPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 1 2","gap":false},{"n":2,"color":"w","san":"c4","uci":"c2c4","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqkb1r/pppppppp/5n2/8/2PP4/8/PP2PPPP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq - 0 2","gap":false},{"n":2,"color":"b","san":"e6","uci":"e7e6","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqkb1r/pppp1ppp/4pn2/8/2PP4/8/PP2PPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 3","gap":false},{"n":3,"color":"w","san":"Nc3","uci":"b1c3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqkb1r/pppp1ppp/4pn2/8/2PP4/2N5/PP2PPPP/R1BQKBNR b KQkq - 1 3","gap":false},{"n":3,"color":"b","san":"Bb4","uci":"f8b4","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqk2r/pppp1ppp/4pn2/8/1bPP4/2N5/PP2PPPP/R1BQKBNR w KQkq - 2 4","gap":false},{"n":4,"color":"w","san":"e3","uci":"e2e3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqk2r/pppp1ppp/4pn2/8/1bPP4/2N1P3/PP3PPP/R1BQKBNR b KQkq - 0 4","gap":false},{"n":4,"color":"b","san":"O-O","uci":"e8g8","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbq1rk1/pppp1ppp/4pn2/8/1bPP4/2N1P3/PP3PPP/R1BQKBNR w KQ - 1 5","gap":false},{"n":5,"color":"w","san":"Bd3","uci":"f1d3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbq1rk1/pppp1ppp/4pn2/8/1bPP4/2NBP3/PP3PPP/R1BQK1NR b KQ - 2 5","gap":false},{"n":5,"color":"b","san":"d5","uci":"d7d5","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbq1rk1/ppp2ppp/4pn2/3p4/1bPP4/2NBP3/PP3PPP/R1BQK1NR w KQ - 0 6","gap":false},{"n":6,"color":"w","san":"cxd5","uci":"c4d5","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbq1rk1/ppp2ppp/4pn2/3P4/1b1P4/2NBP3/PP3PPP/R1BQK1NR b KQ - 0 6","gap":false},{"n":6,"color":"b","san":"exd5","uci":"e6d5","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbq1rk1/ppp2ppp/5n2/3p4/1b1P4/2NBP3/PP3PPP/R1BQK1NR w KQ - 0 7","gap":false},{"n":7,"color":"w","san":"Ne2","uci":"g1e2","nag":"","comentario":"(Este desarrollo evita el problema del cambio en c3, aunque después de que las negras han jugado...d5 ya no es tan importante. Otra posibilidad es 7.Cf3. De todas maneras la idea de las blancas es no obstruir su peón \"f\" para jugar más tarde f3 e intentar e4.)","fen":"rnbq1rk1/ppp2ppp/5n2/3p4/1b1P4/2NBP3/PP2NPPP/R1BQK2R b KQ - 1 7","gap":false},{"n":7,"color":"b","san":"Re8","uci":"f8e8","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqr1k1/ppp2ppp/5n2/3p4/1b1P4/2NBP3/PP2NPPP/R1BQK2R w KQ - 2 8","gap":false},{"n":8,"color":"w","san":"O-O","uci":"e1g1","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqr1k1/ppp2ppp/5n2/3p4/1b1P4/2NBP3/PP2NPPP/R1BQ1RK1 b - - 3 8","gap":false},{"n":8,"color":"b","san":"Bd6","uci":"b4d6","nag":"","comentario":"(La pérdida de tiempo no es tan importante. El alfil ya no hace nada en b4)","fen":"rnbqr1k1/ppp2ppp/3b1n2/3p4/3P4/2NBP3/PP2NPPP/R1BQ1RK1 w - - 4 9","gap":false},{"n":9,"color":"w","san":"a3","uci":"a2a3","nag":"","comentario":"(La continuación más habitual es 9.f3 aunque la jugada de la partida es también aceptable.)","fen":"rnbqr1k1/ppp2ppp/3b1n2/3p4/3P4/P1NBP3/1P2NPPP/R1BQ1RK1 b - - 0 9","gap":false},{"n":9,"color":"b","san":"c6","uci":"c7c6","nag":"","comentario":"(En una partida reciente las negras jugaron 9...Cg4 y tras la errónea 10.h3 (había que jugar 10.Cf4) 10...Ch2 11.Te1 Cf3+ 12.gxf3 Dg5+ 13.Rh1 Dh4 obtuvieron un peligroso ataque. Van Wely-Acs. Essent 2002)","fen":"rnbqr1k1/pp3ppp/2pb1n2/3p4/3P4/P1NBP3/1P2NPPP/R1BQ1RK1 w - - 0 10","gap":false},{"n":10,"color":"w","san":"Qc2","uci":"d1c2","nag":"","comentario":"(Permitiendo la entrega del alfil. Antes de calificar esta jugada de Kasparov como errónea habría que valorar la corrección del sacrificio del alfil, lo que no es nada claro. Posiblemente Kasparov confiaba en que la máquina no entregaría material si no era totalmente claro, por lo que decidió correr el riesgo. Más seguro era 10.Cg3)","fen":"rnbqr1k1/pp3ppp/2pb1n2/3p4/3P4/P1NBP3/1PQ1NPPP/R1B2RK1 b - - 1 10","gap":false},{"n":10,"color":"b","san":"Bxh2+","uci":"d6h2","nag":"","comentario":"(Este sacrificio ha levantado mucha polémica acerca de su corrección y es difícil llegar a una conclusión definitiva. Desde el punto de vista práctico, las negras obtienen suficientes recursos de ataque, pero es interesante apreciar que, contra lo que suele ser habitual, la máquina entrega material de modo bastante especulativo, pues incluso con su enorme capacidad de cálculo es difícil examinar todas las variantes posibles. Seguramente Tal hubiera hecho este sacrificio sin dudarlo demasiado pero en una computadora no deja de ser sorprendente esa decisión)","fen":"rnbqr1k1/pp3ppp/2p2n2/3p4/3P4/P1NBP3/1PQ1NPPb/R1B2RK1 w - - 0 11","gap":false},{"n":11,"color":"w","san":"Kxh2","uci":"g1h2","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqr1k1/pp3ppp/2p2n2/3p4/3P4/P1NBP3/1PQ1NPPK/R1B2R2 b - - 0 11","gap":false},{"n":11,"color":"b","san":"Ng4+","uci":"f6g4","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqr1k1/pp3ppp/2p5/3p4/3P2n1/P1NBP3/1PQ1NPPK/R1B2R2 w - - 1 12","gap":false},{"n":12,"color":"w","san":"Kg3","uci":"h2g3","nag":"","comentario":"(Como es natural 12.Rg1? pierde a causa de 12...Dh4 13.Td1 Dxf2+ 14.Rh1 Te6 el paso de la torre por la tercera es una idea básica en este ataque y tras 15.Cf4 Th6+ 16.Ch3 Dg3 las negras ganan.)","fen":"rnbqr1k1/pp3ppp/2p5/3p4/3P2n1/P1NBP1K1/1PQ1NPP1/R1B2R2 b - - 2 12","gap":false},{"n":12,"color":"b","san":"Qg5","uci":"d8g5","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnb1r1k1/pp3ppp/2p5/3p2q1/3P2n1/P1NBP1K1/1PQ1NPP1/R1B2R2 w - - 3 13","gap":false},{"n":13,"color":"w","san":"f4","uci":"f2f4","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnb1r1k1/pp3ppp/2p5/3p2q1/3P1Pn1/P1NBP1K1/1PQ1N1P1/R1B2R2 b - - 0 13","gap":false},{"n":13,"color":"b","san":"Qh5","uci":"g5h5","nag":"","comentario":"A diferencia de la partida de Capablanca recién examinada, las blancas tienen mucho más desarrolladas sus piezas y el sacrificio es menos claro.","fen":"rnb1r1k1/pp3ppp/2p5/3p3q/3P1Pn1/P1NBP1K1/1PQ1N1P1/R1B2R2 w - - 1 14","gap":false},{"n":14,"color":"w","san":"Bd2","uci":"c1d2","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnb1r1k1/pp3ppp/2p5/3p3q/3P1Pn1/P1NBP1K1/1PQBN1P1/R4R2 b - - 2 14","gap":false},{"n":14,"color":"b","san":"Qh2+","uci":"h5h2","nag":"","comentario":"(Tomar en e3 sería mucho peor: 14...Cxe3? 15.Axe3 Txe3+ 16.Rf2; O 14...Txe3+? 15.Axe3 Cxe3 16.Dd2 Cxf1+ 17.Txf1)","fen":"rnb1r1k1/pp3ppp/2p5/3p4/3P1Pn1/P1NBP1K1/1PQBN1Pq/R4R2 w - - 3 15","gap":false},{"n":15,"color":"w","san":"Kf3","uci":"g3f3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnb1r1k1/pp3ppp/2p5/3p4/3P1Pn1/P1NBPK2/1PQBN1Pq/R4R2 b - - 4 15","gap":false},{"n":15,"color":"b","san":"Qh4","uci":"h2h4","nag":"!","comentario":"(Una posición crítica. La amenaza de mate puede ser parada de dos maneras: 16.g3 y 16.Cg3. En el segundo caso las negras pueden forzar las tablas, mientras que en el primero se llega a una posición de difícil valoración. Kasparov se decidió por la variante de tablas y no es sencillo criticar su decisión pues el ataque negro es muy peligroso.)","fen":"rnb1r1k1/pp3ppp/2p5/3p4/3P1Pnq/P1NBPK2/1PQBN1P1/R4R2 w - - 5 16","gap":false},{"n":16,"color":"w","san":"Bxh7+","uci":"d3h7","nag":"","comentario":"(Esta jugada intermedia no establece mucha diferencia. En todo caso obliga a las blancas a decidirse a continuación por la variante de tablas. 16.g3 Era la única posibilidad de jugar a ganar, aunque corriendo serios riesgos. Señalaremos una interesante variante entre las muchas posibilidades, ya que es imposible agotarlas todas: 16...Dh2!? (16...Dh5 es la alternativa, aunque aquí, con las piezas blancas bien desarrolladas y las torres comunicadas, es menos efectiva a causa de 17.Th1) 17.f5 Cd7!? 18.Rxg4 Dg2 19.Rf4 Cf6 20.e4 dxe4 21.Axe4 Txe4+ 22.Cxe4 Cd5+ 23.Re5 Dxe2 y a pesar de la torre de ventaja, las blancas tienen que superar bastantes peligros todavía.)","fen":"rnb1r1k1/pp3ppB/2p5/3p4/3P1Pnq/P1N1PK2/1PQBN1P1/R4R2 b - - 0 16","gap":false},{"n":16,"color":"b","san":"Kh8","uci":"g8h8","nag":"!","comentario":"(16...Dxh7 17.Dxh7+ Rxh7 es claramente mejor para las blancas.)","fen